<title>POLAND: Polish 1996 grain output down to 24.22-24.97 mln T.</title>
<headline>Polish 1996 grain output down to 24.22-24.97 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's grain production fell to between 24.219 and 24.973 million tonnes this growing season from 25.621 million tonnes in 1995, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said on Friday.</p>
<p>On August 2, GUS said it expected this year's grain output to be flat at last year's levels.  </p>
<p>    PRELIMINARY GRAIN PRODUCTION RESULTS	 1996	1995</p>
<p>    Output (in million tonnes)		24.22-24.97   25.62</p>
<p>    Yields (in quintal/hectare)		28.4-29.3    30.20</p>
<p>    Surface area (million hectares)		8.536     8.484</p>
<p>NOTE - GUS plans to publish its final 1996 production figures in November or December.</p>
<p>--Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
